### Local: page one (start src/server.js first)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8787/items?page=1

### Local: JSON echo
POST http://127.0.0.1:8787/echo
Content-Type: application/json

{"message":"Hello API"}

### Local: intentional authentication failure
GET http://127.0.0.1:8787/bearer

### Local: success with a deliberately public demo token
GET http://127.0.0.1:8787/bearer
Authorization: Bearer local-demo-token

### Public read-only sample for the hosted Playground
GET https://jsonplaceholder.typicode.com/posts/1
